<title>FRANCE: Christian Dior Q1 sales up 66 pct.</title>
<headline>Christian Dior Q1 sales up 66 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 19967</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover		     11,198    vs    6,761</p>
<p>NOTE - Christian Dior gave the figures in a statement and said that on like-for-like basis the sales were up 10.4 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
